ana|bananas]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] and mashed\n* Juice and [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]] of ½ [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n* Juice and zest of ½ [[Cookbook:Orange|orange]]\n* 15 [[Cookbook:Date|dates]], pitted and [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] finely\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] ground [[Cookbook:Walnut|walnuts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ¼ cup red [[Cookbook:Wine|wine]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Matzo Meal|matzo meal]]\n* [[Cookbook:Honey|Honey]] to taste\n\n==Procedure==\n# Mix apples, bananas, lemon juice, lemon zest, orange juice, orange zest, dates, and nuts in a bowl.\n# Add cinnamon, wine, and matzo meal, and blend thoroughly.\n# Mix in honey to taste.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using banana]]\n[[Category:Recipes using date]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Recipes for charoset]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using matzo meal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange zest]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Sweet Charoset","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 apples peeled, cored, and grated","sourceText":"2 apples peeled, cored, and grated","amountText":"2 apples peeled, cored, and grated","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 bananas chopped and mashed","sourceText":"3 bananas chopped and mashed","amountText":"3 bananas chopped and mashed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Juice and zest of ½ lemon","sourceText":"Juice and zest of ½ lemon","amountText":"Juice and zest of ½ lemon","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Juice and zest of ½ orange","sourceText":"Juice and zest of ½ orange","amountText":"Juice